    {"type":"text","id":"preds_t","x":110,"y":540,"width":480,"height":115,"text":"PREDICTIONS  (no status; precision-tuned or deleted)\n\n• event  ·  \"Marcus replies about cap table by EOD May 21\"   p=0.82\n• fact   ·  \"Marcus's reply median is 6h on weekdays\"          p=0.85\n• pattern · \"Marcus signals concern via tone shifts, not words\"  p=0.62","originalText":"PREDICTIONS  (no status; precision-tuned or deleted)\n\n• event  ·  \"Marcus replies about cap table by EOD May 21\"   p=0.82\n• fact   ·  \"Marcus's reply median is 6h on weekdays\"          p=0.85\n• pattern · \"Marcus signals concern via tone shifts, not words\"  p=0.62","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#b45309","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":430003,"version":1,"versionNonce":430004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"preds","lineHeight":1.4},
