    {"type":"text","id":"promote_label","x":820,"y":620,"width":300,"height":40,"text":"PROMOTE\n(mind agent decides; mention count + edges as proxies)","originalText":"PROMOTE\n(mind agent decides; mention count + edges as proxies)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":900003,"version":1,"versionNonce":900004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"text","id":"update_rules","x":80,"y":850,"width":1600,"height":140,"text":"PRECISION UPDATE  (applied per layer; same arithmetic across anchor layers, predictions, and relationship layers)\n\n   support       →    precision += (1 - precision) * 0.1     (slow priors resist; fast priors update readily)\n   contradict    →    precision -= precision * 0.3\n   irrelevant    →    delete the prediction or relationship entirely (no status enum)\n\nIdentity handles are FAST-PATH HINTS, not hard match rules. The mind agent decides actual matches; handles seed the search.","originalText":"PRECISION UPDATE  (applied per layer; same arithmetic across anchor layers, predictions, and relationship layers)\n\n   support       →    precision += (1 - precision) * 0.1     (slow priors resist; fast priors update readily)\n   contradict    →    precision -= precision * 0.3\n   irrelevant    →    delete the prediction or relationship entirely (no status enum)\n\nIdentity handles are FAST-PATH HINTS, not hard match rules. The mind agent decides actual matches; handles seed the search.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1000001,"version":1,"versionNonce":1000002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.5}
